            {
                "entry_id": "9dbb8f74-1eed-37af-a657-ead0686251a0",
                "word": "Antifa",
                "pos": "name",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6bbc2216-cdfb-377e-b096-57d129655086",
                        "entry_id": "9dbb8f74-1eed-37af-a657-ead0686251a0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A decentralized, radical political movement that opposes fascism."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "454818c3-6355-4b40-bf67-22f15d7a2db6",
                                "sense_id": "6bbc2216-cdfb-377e-b096-57d129655086",
                                "text": "Similarly, Antifa organized local defense units that fought off Nazi assaults and factory and land-estate committees that blocked further wage cuts and other infringements."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e0788109-c75e-47d8-8a4a-db6c950343cb",
                                "sense_id": "6bbc2216-cdfb-377e-b096-57d129655086",
                                "text": "The active Communist participation in the leadership of the Antifa committees made them vulnerable to \"red scare\" propaganda, especially from the much more conservative city government."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c7d04b0c-5a3d-4d7d-b3ea-28e656bf0197",
                                "sense_id": "6bbc2216-cdfb-377e-b096-57d129655086",
                                "text": "After an anti-fascist punched a right-wing journalist in Portland, militant anti-fascists and Antifa have been branded as 'violent gangs,' even 'terrorists.' Those definitions are completely wrong."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "57c54688-951b-421c-bbab-48e5b1d9c520",
                                "sense_id": "6bbc2216-cdfb-377e-b096-57d129655086",
                                "text": "And the FBI is not the only federal law enforcement agency that tracks groups associated with the larger Antifa movement."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e1ae8784-17b4-3c41-9074-62f3b3603d40",
                        "entry_id": "9dbb8f74-1eed-37af-a657-ead0686251a0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Black bloc groups that fight fascist or far-right groups in public, usually anarchist, socialist, or communist groups."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "informal",
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
